**Row: growth-and-development → BLANK `direction-only`**

Both snapshots form one `record` group on HB 2570 (56th Leg., 2nd Reg. Sess., 2024), coded `own-act` / `on-question` / `in-term`:

| | vote page | bill text |
|---|---|---|
| `record_kind` | `vote` | `vote` |
